      "id": "wiki-song-lady-brett-young-song-",
      "source": "Wikipedia",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lady_(Brett_Young_song)",
      "excerpt": "\"Lady\" is a song recorded by American country music artist Brett Young. It was released on April 30, 2020, as the lead single from his third studio album, Weekends Look a Little Different These Days, which was released on June 4, 2021. The song was written by Young, along with Jon Nite and Ross Copperman.\nYoung wrote the song for his daughter, Presley Elizabeth, and his wife Taylor Mills.\n\n\nMusic video\nThe video was released on June 18, 2020, directed by Seth Kupersmith. It was shot with a camera and a drone and following social distancing guidelines. The family is shown getting ready for a day at the beach and going to the pool.\n\n\nCharts\n\n\nCertifications\n\n\nReferences\n\n\nExternal links\nOfficial website",
      "confidence": 0.85
    }
